## Full Session CLI Reference

| Command                                                                       | Purpose                                                                  |
| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `eval "$(holly task start --id <issue-id> --intent '<agent-intent>')"`         | Public bootstrap: record task ID, post intent, and unblock tools for existing `HOLLY_SESSION_ID` (idempotent re-entry for your active task) |
| `holly task start --intent "<agent-intent>"`                                  | Single intent-setter: record task, post intent to `all-agents`, mark `intent_posted=true` |
| `holly session claim-vscode-uuid <uuid>`                                                  | Map VS Code UUID to current session                                      |
| `holly session workspace bootstrap --name "Name" --uuid <uuid>`               | Create origin workspace session and claim UUID                           |
| `holly session workspace bootstrap --name "Name" --uuid <uuid> --repo <path>` | Add a repo-local session for a target repo                               |
| `holly session workspace bootstrap --name "Name" --uuid <uuid> --all-repos`   | Eagerly bootstrap every git repo in the VS Code workspace                |
| `holly session status`                                                        | Show current session details                                             |
| `holly session list`                                                          | List all sessions                                                        |
| `holly session activity`                                                      | Refresh activity timestamp                                               |
| `holly task start --intent "<agent-intent>"`                                    | Debug: record intent-only task and post intent                           |
| `holly task status`                                                   | Debug: confirm intent, unblock tools                                     |
| `holly task abort`                                                    | Archive current task                                                     |
| `holly session end`                                                           | End current session                                                      |
| `holly session sweep`                                                         | End expired idle sessions (cron)                                         |
| `holly session prune`                                                         | Remove stale entries from sessions file                                  |
| `holly session subagent register <name> [--task "..."]`                       | Register a subagent entry on the current session                         |
| `holly session subagent complete [target] [--status <status>]`                | Mark a registered subagent completed/failed                              |
| `holly session subagent active`                                               | List status-active subagents on the current session                      |

All commands accept `--json` for machine-readable output.

